[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Module Requirements — extensions.py, context.py, isolation.py

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-EXTENSIONS-001
TITLE: load_project_extensions — Enumerate Project Agent Extensions
STATEMENT: >>>
Scan .claude/3-project/ for <role>-ext.md files (project-specific extensions).
Return: dict {role: {content, file}}.
Extensions are never managed by sync.py — always preserved.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Extension enumeration enables additive project customization without sync.py interference.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_extensions.py::test_load_project_extensions
<<<
TAGS: extensions, loading, project
STATUS: Active
PRIORITY: P1
OWNER: @daniel
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: implements
  VALUE: REQ-SYS-012
- TYPE: called-by
  VALUE: REQ-EXTENSIONS-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-EXTENSIONS-002
TITLE: parse_managed_blocks — Extract Managed Sections
STATEMENT: >>>
Identify {{# managed begin:* }} blocks in extensions (auto-updated sections).
Return: list of (start_line, end_line, content) tuples.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Managed blocks enable selective auto-update of extension sections.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_extensions.py::test_parse_managed_blocks_valid
- tests/test_extensions.py::test_parse_managed_blocks_unmatched_markers
<<<
TAGS: extensions, managed, blocks
STATUS: Active
PRIORITY: P1
OWNER: @daniel
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: called-by
  VALUE: REQ-EXTENSIONS-003

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-EXTENSIONS-003
TITLE: merge_extension_with_agent — Combine Base Agent + Extension
STATEMENT: >>>
Append extension to generated agent:
  1. Load generated agent
  2. Load extension
  3. Preserve non-managed sections
  4. For managed blocks: update if base changed
Return: merged content.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Merge logic preserves project customization while enabling selective updates.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_extensions.py::test_merge_extension_with_agent_full
- tests/test_extensions.py::test_merge_extension_with_agent_managed_updated
<<<
TAGS: extensions, merging, composition
STATUS: Active
PRIORITY: P1
OWNER: @daniel
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: calls
  VALUE: REQ-EXTENSIONS-001, REQ-EXTENSIONS-002
- TYPE: called-by
  VALUE: REQ-AGENTS-007

