[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-CONTEXT-001
TITLE: inject_computed_variables — Compute Framework Values
STATEMENT: >>>
Compute framework-level variables:
  - {{FRAMEWORK_VERSION}} from VERSION file
  - {{AGENT_HINTS}} from agent hints
  - {{AGENTS_TABLE}} markdown table
  - {{PARALLEL_PATTERN}} from provider config
Return: dict of additional variables.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Computed variables enable dynamic template rendering based on framework state.
<<<
