[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-CONTEXT-005
TITLE: build_full_context — Orchestrate All Context Building
STATEMENT: >>>
build_full_context(project, providers_config, agent_meta_root):
  1. Load project config
  2. Inject computed variables
  3. Load MCP bundles
  4. Inject DoD variables
Return: complete context dict for {{VAR}} substitution.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Centralized context assembly ensures all variables are available for substitution.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_context.py::test_build_full_context
<<<
