[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ISOLATION-005
TITLE: sync_provider_isolation — Orchestrate All Isolation Sync
STATEMENT: >>>
sync_provider_isolation(active_providers, provider_config, isolation_enabled):
  1. Check if isolation needed (>1 provider, isolation_enabled=true)
  2. For each provider: apply provider-specific isolation
Return: summary {providers_isolated, rules_applied}.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Orchestration ensures consistent isolation across all providers.
<<<
VERIFICATION: >>>
- tests/test_isolation.py::test_sync_provider_isolation_e2e
